{"id": "c:flipper:001", "text": "FCC ID 2A2V6-FZ was granted to Flipper Devices Inc on 14 January 2022.", "quote": "FCC ID 2A2V6-FZ, granted 14 Jan 2022 to Flipper Devices Inc.", "from": "datapack.md#the-worked-example-radio-equipment-certification-and-flipper-zero", "sources": [{"doc": "docpack/05-device-certification-flipper-zero/fcc-id-2a2v6-fz-fccid-io-mirror.pdf", "url": "https://fccid.io/2A2V6-FZ", "fetched": "2026-10-17"}], "entities": ["e:flipper-zero", "e:flipper-devices", "e:fcc", "e:fcc-grant-2a2v6-fz"], "kind": "date", "by": "p:datapack", "asserted": "2026-10-22", "status": "live", "confidence": "sourced", "note": ""}
{"id": "c:flipper:002", "text": "The Flipper Zero grant certifies Bluetooth at 2.4 GHz, a 13.56 MHz NFC device, and sub-GHz transmission under 47 CFR 15.231 in three windows only: 304.5-321.95, 433.075-434.775 and 915-927.95 MHz.", "quote": "It certifies Bluetooth at 2.4 GHz, a 13.56 MHz NFC device, and sub-GHz transmission under Part 15.231 (periodic remote-control rules) in three windows only: 304.5-321.95, 433.075-434.775 and 915-927.95 MHz.", "from": "datapack.md#the-worked-example-radio-equipment-certification-and-flipper-zero", "sources": [{"doc": "docpack/05-device-certification-flipper-zero/fcc-id-2a2v6-fz-fccid-io-mirror.pdf", "url": "https://fccid.io/2A2V6-FZ", "fetched": "2026-10-17"}], "entities": ["e:fcc-grant-2a2v6-fz", "e:47-cfr-15-231"], "kind": "fact", "by": "p:datapack", "asserted": "2026-10-22", "status": "live", "confidence": "sourced", "note": ""}
{"id": "c:flipper:003", "text": "The Flipper Zero grant's public exhibits include the manual, photos and test reports; the schematic, block diagram and operational description are under long-term confidentiality.", "quote": "Public exhibits include the manual, photos and test reports; the schematic, block diagram and operational description are under long-term confidentiality.", "from": "datapack.md#the-worked-example-radio-equipment-certification-and-flipper-zero", "sources": [{"doc": "docpack/05-device-certification-flipper-zero/fcc-id-2a2v6-fz-fccid-io-mirror.pdf", "url": "https://fccid.io/2A2V6-FZ", "fetched": "2026-10-17"}], "entities": ["e:fcc-grant-2a2v6-fz"], "kind": "fact", "by": "p:datapack", "asserted": "2026-10-22", "status": "live", "confidence": "sourced", "note": ""}
{"id": "c:flipper:004", "text": "No software-defined-radio declaration appears in the exhibit list of the Flipper Zero grant.", "quote": "No SDR declaration appears in the exhibit list", "from": "datapack.md#the-worked-example-radio-equipment-certification-and-flipper-zero", "sources": [{"doc": "docpack/05-device-certification-flipper-zero/fcc-id-2a2v6-fz-fccid-io-mirror.pdf", "url": "https://fccid.io/2A2V6-FZ", "fetched": "2026-10-17"}], "entities": ["e:fcc-grant-2a2v6-fz", "e:47-cfr-2-944"], "kind": "fact", "by": "p:datapack", "asserted": "2026-10-22", "status": "live", "confidence": "inferred", "note": "A claim about an absence in a public exhibit list"}
{"id": "c:flipper:005", "text": "An FCC certification grant is issued by an FCC-recognised Telecommunication Certification Body on accredited laboratory data and is posted to the FCC's public database.", "quote": "A certification grant is issued by an FCC-recognised Telecommunication Certification Body on accredited lab data and posted to the public database", "from": "datapack.md#the-worked-example-radio-equipment-certification-and-flipper-zero", "sources": [{"doc": "docpack/05-device-certification-flipper-zero/fcc-equipment-authorisation.pdf", "url": "https://www.fcc.gov/node/23689", "fetched": "2026-10-17"}], "entities": ["e:fcc", "e:fcc-tcb"], "kind": "rule", "by": "p:datapack", "asserted": "2026-10-22", "status": "live", "confidence": "sourced", "note": ""}
{"id": "c:flipper:006", "text": "The Flipper Zero attestation exists, is public and names the grantee, but does not name a firmware hash.", "quote": "So the attestation exists, is public, and names the grantee; what it does not name is a firmware hash.", "from": "datapack.md#the-worked-example-radio-equipment-certification-and-flipper-zero", "sources": [{"doc": "docpack/05-device-certification-flipper-zero/fcc-id-2a2v6-fz-fccid-io-mirror.pdf", "url": "https://fccid.io/2A2V6-FZ", "fetched": "2026-10-17"}], "entities": ["e:fcc-grant-2a2v6-fz", "e:binding", "e:firmware-hash-binding"], "kind": "fact", "by": "p:datapack", "asserted": "2026-10-22", "status": "live", "confidence": "sourced", "note": ""}
{"id": "c:flipper:007", "text": "47 CFR 15.15(b) requires a device to be designed so that no user-accessible control can take it outside the rules.", "quote": "A device must be designed so no user-accessible control can take it outside the rules", "from": "datapack.md#the-worked-example-radio-equipment-certification-and-flipper-zero", "sources": [{"doc": "docpack/05-device-certification-flipper-zero/47-cfr-15-15.pdf", "url": "https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/47/15.15", "fetched": "2026-10-17"}], "entities": ["e:47-cfr-15-15", "e:fcc"], "kind": "rule", "by": "p:datapack", "asserted": "2026-10-22", "status": "live", "confidence": "sourced", "note": ""}
{"id": "c:flipper:008", "text": "47 CFR 2.944 requires that for software-defined radios only approved software may load, enforced by authenticated download, signatures or hardware codes.", "quote": "For software-defined radios, only approved software may load, enforced by authenticated download, signatures or hardware codes", "from": "datapack.md#the-worked-example-radio-equipment-certification-and-flipper-zero", "sources": [{"doc": "docpack/05-device-certification-flipper-zero/47-cfr-2-944.pdf", "url": "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-47/chapter-I/subchapter-A/part-2/subpart-J/subject-group-ECFRd5ad3b739dbf27a/section-2.944", "fetched": "2026-10-17"}], "entities": ["e:47-cfr-2-944", "e:fcc"], "kind": "rule", "by": "p:datapack", "asserted": "2026-10-22", "status": "live", "confidence": "sourced", "note": ""}
{"id": "c:flipper:009", "text": "Under 47 CFR 2.944, if third parties are expected to modify the software that controls RF behaviour, the device must be certified as a software-defined radio.", "quote": "if third parties are expected to modify RF-controlling software, the device must be certified as an SDR", "from": "datapack.md#the-worked-example-radio-equipment-certification-and-flipper-zero", "sources": [{"doc": "docpack/05-device-certification-flipper-zero/47-cfr-2-944.pdf", "url": "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-47/chapter-I/subchapter-A/part-2/subpart-J/subject-group-ECFRd5ad3b739dbf27a/section-2.944", "fetched": "2026-10-17"}], "entities": ["e:47-cfr-2-944", "e:fcc"], "kind": "rule", "by": "p:datapack", "asserted": "2026-10-22", "status": "live", "confidence": "sourced", "note": ""}
{"id": "c:flipper:010", "text": "47 CFR 2.1043 defines three classes of permissive change: Class I with no filing, Class II where the grantee files test data, and Class III for SDR software exceeding approved limits, which needs new test data.", "quote": "Permissive changes: Class I (no filing), Class II (grantee files test data), Class III (SDR software exceeding approved limits, new test data)", "from": "datapack.md#the-worked-example-radio-equipment-certification-and-flipper-zero", "sources": [{"doc": "docpack/05-device-certification-flipper-zero/47-cfr-2-1043.pdf", "url": "https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/47/2.1043", "fetched": "2026-10-17"}], "entities": ["e:47-cfr-2-1043", "e:fcc"], "kind": "rule", "by": "p:datapack", "asserted": "2026-10-22", "status": "live", "confidence": "sourced", "note": ""}

